Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(现在)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你喜欢聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you liked talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.71,0:00:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"在火堆前跟陌生人聊聊天"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Little chats with a stranger by the fire."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说那很像电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it was like the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:32.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你说你想要我有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you said that you want everything that I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every last bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我现在给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.00,0:00:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every last bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(过去)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(清理)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.21,0:01:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.03,0:01:08.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.22,0:01:11.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:14.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(清理)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.58,0:01:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管多少天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter how many days...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}or how much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不该去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We weren't supposed to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿着刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:44.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:43.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你该那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you were supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:02:00.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你该那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that you were supposed to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(清理)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm s-- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.13,0:07:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有  你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没有  你知道你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't! You know you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(毫无意义的行为)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:20.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(这不是那里)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.28,0:08:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(清理)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're-- you're still doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能离羊远点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you step away from the goat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不是你的  我还需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not yours. I still need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在想办法做奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still figuring out how to make cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你把枪放下  我们聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you put the gun down and we'll talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.26,0:11:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃点炸豆丸子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some falafel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.11,0:11:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你有阵子没吃东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you haven't eaten for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的  放下步枪  我们聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, put down the rifle, let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们肯定能和平解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  最后一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下枪  离开小屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your gun, step away from the cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.77,0:12:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.98,0:13:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这名字真蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a stupid name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该换个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:15.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我  杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me! Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(平静的艺术)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.24,0:13:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫伊斯特曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Eastman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  塔比瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Tabitha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.86,0:14:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抢走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.16,0:14:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你的就是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yours or his.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以抢走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.53,0:15:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,19小时里有16小时都躺在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}16 hours in 19 on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.21,0:15:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.16,0:15:24.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对我开枪  我却给你吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot at me. I fed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.33,0:15:26.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请不要伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,19小时里有16小时都躺在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}16 hours in 19 on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.08,0:17:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that is--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:04.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真难吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  那真\N{\fnArial\fs30}That-- oh, God, that is--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.06,0:17:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那真难吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.01,0:17:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想等一阵子  然后再跟你聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to wait a little while before we talked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.06,0:17:31.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来自亚特兰大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm from Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是犯罪心理学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a forensic psychiatrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:37.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,政府雇我来评估\N{\fnArial\fs30}The state employed me to determine
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一些做过坏事的人出狱后\N{\fnArial\fs30}if certain people who did very bad things would do them again
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.86,0:17:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会重蹈覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if they were released from prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前那是我的工作  现在我住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my job. Now I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为全国和世界的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the state of the state and the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前是做什么的  现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do or what do you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.93,0:18:00.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.54,0:18:02.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸  人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers, people,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.69,0:18:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有东西靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}anything that gets anywhere near me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:09.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.05,0:18:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:15.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有那样我才能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's why I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.95,0:18:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我听过的最扯的屁话\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the biggest load of horseshit I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.09,0:18:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是创伤后遗症\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's PTSD.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.30,0:19:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你受过精神创伤  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been through trauma, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见我棍子顶端的血迹了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that blood on the end of my stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尖的那一头上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the sharp end?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是两个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.46,0:19:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是父亲和儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father and son, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.24,0:20:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我捅穿了其中一个的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stabbed one through the throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就那样...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喉咙里插着棍子倒在了地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}fell to the ground with it stuck in him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.00,0:20:07.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还试图呛着血呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to breathe through the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.02,0:20:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我勒死了另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other one I strangled.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.18,0:20:13.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用绳子  徒手杀死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No rope, just my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.03,0:20:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那发生在我到这里的前一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the day before I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.14,0:20:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就是同一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.67,0:20:23.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-- I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前就是干那个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀过很多人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed a lot of people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:36.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们威胁到你了或是攻击你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were threatening you, attacking you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救过人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无意义的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pointless acts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.05,0:20:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都转化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:55.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前看到了一枚婚戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a wedding ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.43,0:21:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有过爱人  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had someone you loved, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.39,0:21:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爱他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:11.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定是很爱他们才会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You loved them a lot if you're like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.51,0:21:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你目睹了悲剧的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你就变成了这样  是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how this started, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.86,0:21:23.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有悲剧都在你眼前一次又一次上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all happening right in front of your eyes over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.34,0:21:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的身体在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body's here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.97,0:21:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但心还在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your mind is still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a door
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.17,0:21:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想穿过它  然后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want to go through it to get away from it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:33.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你穿过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.37,0:21:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它却将你领回了那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it leads you right back to that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.75,0:21:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你又看见了那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you see that door again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:40.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道它不起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know it won't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.79,0:21:41.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  管他呢  也许会有用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, hell, maybe it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你又踏入了那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you step through that door
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.47,0:21:46.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后每次都回到那可怕的一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're right back in that horrible moment every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:48.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仍然每次都能感觉得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still feel it every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就不想再打开那扇门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just want to stop opening that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是坐在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just sit in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.48,0:21:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I assure you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:58.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其中一扇门可以出去  我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of those doors leads out, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.47,0:22:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有任何朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.03,0:22:02.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好认识下我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.97,0:22:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -因为我必须清理\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - Because I have to clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  这才是问题所在  你不必的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that's the thing. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:11.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人不是我们的本性\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not built to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.02,0:22:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们生来没有利爪  獠牙和针刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have claws or fangs or armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.50,0:22:20.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,患了创伤后遗症的老兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vets that came back with PTSD,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.28,0:22:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是因为我们愿意杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that didn't happen because we're comfortable with killing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.02,0:22:26.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不愿意  我们不可能愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not. We can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.14,0:22:28.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有感情  我们是血脉相连的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We feel. We're connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我评估过超过825个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've interviewed over 825 people
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:32.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做过坏事的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who've done terrible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.94,0:22:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只遇到过一个真正的恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only met one evil person.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人生来脑袋不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them were born with bad brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些人是因为成长环境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them got sick along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下的不过是受过创伤的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest were just damaged people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.64,0:22:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你一样受到创伤  但是他们能够痊愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traumatized themselves like you, but they could heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.66,0:22:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些好的彻底  有些不彻底  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Some more, some less,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.84,0:22:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们能痊愈  我们都能\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they can. We all can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:22:52.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万物循环往复  一报还一报\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a circle and everything gets a return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门是敞开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.91,0:23:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这扇牢门  是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That door right there. The cell door, it's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.89,0:23:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不久前把钥匙扔进河里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I threw the key in the river a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.50,0:23:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再关着你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna hold you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.68,0:23:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法阻止你  去清理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stop you. Go, clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.66,0:23:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者留下  睡在沙发上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or stay, crash on the couch,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.56,0:23:21.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们试图帮你找到其他出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll try to find you another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.05,0:23:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都开着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been open all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.32,0:23:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下或离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay or you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只有这两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.68,0:23:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会允许你杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not allow you to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.86,0:23:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.89,0:24:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.75,0:24:16.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.91,0:24:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给了你两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:32.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.85,0:25:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.76,0:25:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给了你两个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you two choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.80,0:25:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门或沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door or the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.26,0:26:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是合气道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Aikido.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.94,0:26:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我之前击败你所用的那招\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I kicked your ass earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.97,0:26:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者说用那招扭转了你的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's how I redirected your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.82,0:27:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮国家评估的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people in prison I evaluated for the state,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.38,0:27:07.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the stories I heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.86,0:27:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犯人们做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}the things these people did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.11,0:27:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天晚上  我喝了8罐啤酒后\N{\fnArial\fs30}One night, my five-year-old daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.98,0:27:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我5岁的女儿看到我在车库哭  \N{\fnArial\fs30}found me crying in the garage after about eight beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.90,0:27:20.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉她  我心里有点难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her I wasn't feeling too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.94,0:27:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就给了我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.25,0:27:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是她那天在学校联欢时赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had won it at a carnival at school that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.74,0:27:37.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她说  这个会给我带来好运  并让我好受些\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said it'd make me lucky and I'd feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.91,0:27:40.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二天早上我看到一张合气道的传单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next morning I found a flyer for aikido.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.18,0:27:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到还真管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn thing worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.64,0:27:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妻子和女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife and your daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.40,0:27:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.70,0:28:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,合气道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was aikido.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.32,0:28:05.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会有帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.20,0:28:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们要踏上旅途  你显然需要帮助 \N{\fnArial\fs30}And you obviously need help if we're gonna make this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.21,0:28:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能一直只有你和我走下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't just be me and you to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.23,0:28:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你太不健谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a shit conversationalist,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.62,0:28:19.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我又不能独自上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I can't make this trip by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.29,0:28:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上路去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A trip where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.88,0:28:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.77,0:28:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.08,0:29:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这草味儿有点太像人造草坪的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grassy notes are a little too Astroturf,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.46,0:29:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是有潜力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's potential here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.18,0:29:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜力总是有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.15,0:29:47.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有生命的地方就有潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there's life, there's potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃素食有一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a vegetarian for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.25,0:29:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我之前还担心那头该死的山羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid that damn goat
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.75,0:29:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会把我变成严格的素食主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}was gonna make me a vegan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.77,0:29:58.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不杀生  但我暂时不打算放弃巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't kill, but I'm not giving up on chocolate any time soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.74,0:30:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能注意到了  我不打算放弃巧克力甜饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might notice I'm not giving up on the Goo Goo Clusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.03,0:30:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的菜单上会一直有它\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna remain on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.27,0:30:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该尝尝  很好吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should try one. They're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.09,0:30:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你是活人  有点生气吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you're alive. Live a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.27,0:30:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该出门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.21,0:30:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然这里有很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a lot here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.16,0:30:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还是应该为旅途找些必需品回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we should scavenge some things up for the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.10,0:30:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.29,0:30:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出去时  你能帮我看着塔比瑟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you watch Tabitha while I'm gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.47,0:30:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我这个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.47,0:31:15.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(平静的艺术)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.16,0:31:27.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(合气道即不杀之道)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.16,0:31:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(尽管大部分武道流派都规定不杀生  但是同时也默许为正义而取人性命)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.16,0:31:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(然而在合气道中  我们完全避免杀戮)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.16,0:31:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(即使面对最邪恶的人)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.92,0:34:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弄坏了一株番茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you maimed a tomato plant,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.84,0:34:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你今天似乎救了山羊  我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it looks to me like you saved a goat today, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.75,0:35:03.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.54,0:35:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.93,0:35:20.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.10,0:36:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有两件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A and B.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.76,0:36:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先  你弄坏了栅栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-- you broke the garden fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.18,0:36:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟蹋了一株完好的番茄\N{\fnArial\fs30}laid waste to a perfectly good tomato plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.34,0:36:13.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得负责修好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.93,0:36:16.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其次  跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}B-- follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.45,0:36:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把你的矛修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fixed your spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.53,0:37:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要义在于扭转\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about redirecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.44,0:37:28.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,规避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evading.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.21,0:37:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至是关心对手的安危\N{\fnArial\fs30}And actually caring about the welfare of your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.36,0:37:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你要关爱自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have to care about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.87,0:37:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要相信你的命很宝贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to believe your life is precious,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.22,0:37:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的生命都是宝贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.52,0:37:50.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要扭转你的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to redirect those thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.93,0:37:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和与此相悖的过往经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}the history that tells you otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往事不可追\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we've done, we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.09,0:38:08.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们通过前进来规避过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We evade it by moving forward
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.28,0:38:10.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秉承着绝不再犯的原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a code to never to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.84,0:38:15.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为从前赎罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.44,0:38:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依然接受自己曾经的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To still accept what we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.49,0:38:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接受所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To accept everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.24,0:38:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.55,0:38:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从而保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in doing that, protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.32,0:39:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,创造平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}To create peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.97,0:39:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你屋里为什么会有一个牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have a cell in your cabin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.67,0:39:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和妻子一起建造了这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built this place with my wife
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.92,0:39:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我女儿出生之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}a while before our daughter was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.38,0:39:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候还没有牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't have a cell back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.86,0:39:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是客厅的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was just the other side of the living room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.78,0:39:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我评估过超过800个男人和25个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my job I interviewed over 800 men and 25 women
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.39,0:39:40.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都做过可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}convicted of awful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.45,0:39:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,源自人性最黑暗处的罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuff from the darkest part of the human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.15,0:39:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在评估一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was evaluating a man
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:50.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名为克赖顿·达拉斯·威尔顿的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the name of Crighton Dallas Wilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.37,0:39:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这名字  听起来仿佛他拥有一家石油公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name like that, sounded like he should own an oil company
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.17,0:39:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴一顶大帽子  克赖顿·达拉斯·威尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wear a big hat-- Crighton Dallas Wilton.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.24,0:40:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管犯了可怕的恶行  他还是有了假释的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite doing some truly unspeakable acts, he was up for parole.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.40,0:40:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我见过的最讨喜的人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was one of the most damn likable people I had ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.81,0:40:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会说好话  参加了心理治疗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said all the right things, he went to therapy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.69,0:40:12.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给监狱委员会写信申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wrote letters to the prison board to start a program
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.77,0:40:15.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个种花的项目  把花摆在等候室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}to grow flowers for the waiting rooms
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.23,0:40:17.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公立医院里  疗养院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in state hospitals, rest homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.37,0:40:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我一眼看穿了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saw right through him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.82,0:40:24.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看穿了他是一个真正的变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw that he was a true psychopath,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.40,0:40:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道怎么操纵别人  他深谙此道\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he knew how to play people, exactly how to play people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.88,0:40:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在食堂旁边和他谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was interviewing him next to the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.11,0:40:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那地方充满工业化披萨味儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place smelled of industrial pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.12,0:40:34.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在给地板打蜡\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were polishing the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.21,0:40:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一半时间得喊着问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to shout my questions half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.73,0:40:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么一瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there was this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.82,0:40:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不记得具体对话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't even remember the exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.14,0:40:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一瞬间我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But right then I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.90,0:40:51.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱顿明白我看穿他的真实面目了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Crighton knew that I knew exactly what he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.41,0:40:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前他所说所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything he had said, done to hide away
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.86,0:40:58.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向别人隐瞒自己的努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he was from everyone, from himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.18,0:41:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都白费了  然后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}just slipped away, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.15,0:41:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个蹲过十年牢的模范囚犯站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that model prisoner of 10 years stood up,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.65,0:41:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面带微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}smiled,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲着我的脸狠狠地来了一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just cracked me across the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.53,0:41:13.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的拳头就像石块一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fist felt like a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.70,0:41:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他压在我身上  隔壁的地板打蜡器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he was on top of me and the floor polisher next door
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.07,0:41:19.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掩盖住了所有声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}was thudding out every sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.08,0:41:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.33,0:41:24.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了他的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I saw his face,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.57,0:41:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}his-- his eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.03,0:41:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的恶念\N{\fnArial\fs30}his evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.46,0:41:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他撕下了面具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mask had slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.46,0:41:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会当场把我打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was gonna kill me right then and there
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.60,0:41:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他知道我会确保他不再出狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he knew I would make sure he would never get out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.73,0:41:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,握臂反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arm bar counter
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.28,0:42:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是僵持不下时使用的招式\N{\fnArial\fs30}for being choked from a pinned position.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.52,0:42:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,合气道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aikido.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.66,0:42:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是学来防身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't taking it for self-defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.75,0:42:11.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这的确救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.35,0:42:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还确保了他再也不会出狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got to make sure he never got out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.12,0:42:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, got to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.57,0:42:22.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他越狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.89,0:42:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找对了人  帮了他一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talked to the right people who got him the right things
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.85,0:42:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就越狱了  但他不是为了逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he broke out, but it wasn't to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.80,0:42:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克莱顿·达拉斯·威尔顿去了我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crighton Dallas Wilton went to my home
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.98,0:42:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我的妻子  女儿和儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and killed my wife, my daughter, and my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.68,0:42:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他浑身沾着他们的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He walked down the street to the police station
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.66,0:42:45.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,径直走进了街角的警局\N{\fnArial\fs30}around the corner covered in their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.40,0:42:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他自首了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.62,0:42:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他越狱唯一的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said the only reason he broke out
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.35,0:42:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是毁掉我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to destroy my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.54,0:43:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}A year passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.12,0:43:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还在种地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he was still working those plots.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.13,0:43:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就让他种地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just let him work those plots
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.07,0:43:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在85号公路边\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the roads out by 85,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.42,0:43:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种菊花  勿忘我\N{\fnArial\fs30}grow chrysanthemums, forget-me-nots.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.29,0:43:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建造了那个牢笼  一心想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I built that cell with the full intention
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.45,0:43:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把克莱顿·达拉斯·威尔顿带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}of bringing Crighton Dallas Wilton here,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.24,0:43:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他关在栅栏后面  让他活活饿死\N{\fnArial\fs30}putting him behind those bars and watching him starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.72,0:43:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.03,0:43:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.17,0:43:47.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有生命都是宝贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.23,0:43:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使是那种人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even for a man like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.41,0:43:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对你  对你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.66,0:43:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做出了那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.64,0:43:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我开始相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.31,0:44:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有生命都是宝贵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.34,0:44:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才能在这吃燕麦汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're having oatmeal burgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.67,0:44:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很擅长嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're good at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.93,0:44:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说扭转想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redirecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.29,0:44:43.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多的器材\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need more gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.69,0:44:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防水布  撬棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tarp, crowbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们可以去一些沿海岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking we could try for the islands off the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.33,0:44:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们也许去那里避难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think people could have gone there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.43,0:44:53.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少  我们能看看海滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, at the very least, we could see the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.47,0:44:57.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.49,0:45:02.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道在哪能找到那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where we can find all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.80,0:45:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(清理)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.24,0:45:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(你只有一次机会)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.17,0:45:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(毫无意义的行为)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.86,0:45:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(这不是那里)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.00,0:45:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你失去了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did you lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.50,0:45:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的妻子和儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife and son.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.92,0:46:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你失去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.08,0:46:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their names.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.25,0:46:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮和德韦恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny and Duane.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.12,0:46:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.25,0:46:25.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不要感到抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.01,0:46:33.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forms, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.41,0:46:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.80,0:46:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.10,0:47:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还会抱上孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna hold a baby again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.38,0:47:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.35,0:48:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.65,0:48:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了不要在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.15,0:48:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't for you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.97,0:48:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能那样  你不该那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do that? That wasn't for you to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.84,0:48:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just--
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.79,0:48:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能干涉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't just step in!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.96,0:48:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.80,0:48:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我怎么样了  告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how it is! Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.78,0:49:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.69,0:49:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.01,0:49:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.03,0:49:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经摆脱这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are done with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.71,0:49:14.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.80,0:49:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.72,0:49:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.96,0:49:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.39,0:50:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了不要在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.00,0:50:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这才是问题所在  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's the thing, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.37,0:50:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.63,0:50:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(毫无意义的行为)
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.31,0:52:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.92,0:53:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她跑出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.35,0:53:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也发现了门是开着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She figured out the door was open, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.26,0:53:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.83,0:53:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.68,0:53:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.52,0:53:35.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.79,0:53:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  快坐下歇会  不然要摔倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you sit down before you fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.35,0:54:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(克莱顿·达拉斯·威尔顿)
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.76,0:54:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如我所说  他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, like I said, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.07,0:54:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他在85号公路边上种地\N{\fnArial\fs30}let him work the plots beside 85.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.59,0:54:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便是在他干出那事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even after what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.63,0:54:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他太他妈讨喜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let him because he was so damn charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.74,0:54:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我查到了作息表  静候时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found out the schedule, waited,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.45,0:54:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确保正确的人在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}made sure the right people were working.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.52,0:54:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快地把他拽到我车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him in my car quick
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.62,0:54:53.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带他来了这\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brought him back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.91,0:54:57.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要是抓到我了  也没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they'd have caught me, it'd have been fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.47,0:55:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能还更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd have been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.36,0:55:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我把他带到这来  他们也不知道去哪找\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got him here and they didn't know where to look.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.74,0:55:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.30,0:55:16.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.75,0:55:19.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.96,0:55:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他关到牢里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put him in that cell...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.53,0:55:35.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他活活饿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I let him starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.24,0:55:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花了47天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took 47 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.05,0:55:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我就自暴自弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.86,0:55:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.41,0:55:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也放弃了再打开那扇门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wasn't trying to open up the door anymore either.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.13,0:55:58.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对他所做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.01,0:56:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没能让我得到内心的平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}it didn't give me any peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.60,0:56:05.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有在我决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found my peace
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.93,0:56:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不杀生后才找到了那份平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I decided to never kill again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.20,0:56:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永不杀生\N{\fnArial\fs30}To never kill anything again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.42,0:56:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我决定解决这事时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I decided to settle things,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.03,0:56:22.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我便回到亚特兰大自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went back to Atlanta to turn myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.41,0:56:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时我才知道世界末日了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I found out the world ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.61,0:56:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但世界并没有末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the world hasn't ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.01,0:56:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有进步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.44,0:56:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我女儿在我们家走廊墙上画的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter drew this on the hallway wall of our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.49,0:56:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她以为我会生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thought I'd get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.93,0:56:54.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是加了个画框\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just put a frame around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.97,0:57:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回去后  发现我没法自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I went back, when I found out I couldn't turn myself in
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.35,0:57:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为已经没有警察了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there was no one to turn myself in to,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.40,0:57:06.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回到家把这从墙上割了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went back home to cut this from the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.99,0:57:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来的时候车丢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost the car on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.93,0:57:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我穿过三十英里的行尸群\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walked through 30 miles of the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.29,0:57:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只为了块墙画\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a piece of drywall.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.27,0:57:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我做过最恐怖的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scariest thing I ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.40,0:57:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是我做过最值的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best thing I ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.84,0:57:31.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.99,0:57:35.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有足够的食物  电力  很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have enough food, power, security.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.48,0:57:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你下半生都可以住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the rest of your life, you could stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.15,0:57:40.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不该留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you shouldn't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.92,0:57:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕不会再有你这么杰出的客人登门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't expect such a splendid guest as yourself to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.04,0:57:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你留在这里  会孤单一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here, you'll be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.50,0:57:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前就很孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.71,0:57:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.23,0:57:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生命中一切有意义的事情都是为了人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in this life that's worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.67,0:58:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该只有我  不该只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It couldn't be just me. It shouldn't be just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.67,0:58:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼  现在连塔比瑟都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, Tabitha's gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.94,0:58:14.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.77,0:58:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那边的闭锁箱里有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a gun in the lockbox out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.39,0:58:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.55,0:58:32.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.02,0:58:44.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿也能给你带来好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope it's lucky for you, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.72,0:58:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你怎么决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.74,0:58:50.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经决定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.91,0:59:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(伊斯特曼)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.14,1:01:11.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(避难所和社区  欢迎所有人  抵达就能活命  终点站)
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.30,1:01:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.89,1:01:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一滴都说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every last bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.86,1:01:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那一套对我管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it can work out that way with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.26,1:01:32.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.54,1:01:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it can.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.33,1:01:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.72,1:01:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你注意到我有点发抖吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You noticed I'm shaking a little?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.95,1:01:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点流汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweating a little?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.23,1:01:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.87,1:02:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在找到的照片上看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw how settled this place was
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.36,1:02:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方多么安定\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the pictures I found.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.02,1:02:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这里也许有些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe there'd be something here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.92,1:02:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能疗伤的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medicine to help this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.09,1:02:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那是在你们的人赢了之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was before you people won.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.74,1:02:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我知道我很可能会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I know I'm probably going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.73,1:02:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果我没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.55,1:02:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须得杀了你  摩根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to have to kill you, Morgan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.57,1:02:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须得杀了这里的每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to have to kill every person here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.46,1:02:41.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人  包括孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one of them. The children, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.93,1:02:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你朋友伊斯特曼的孩子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your friend Eastman's children.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.53,1:02:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.52,1:02:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my code.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.18,1:02:55.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.16,1:02:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你说过的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you said it, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.55,1:03:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不要感到抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.77,1:03:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.62,1:04:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the gate!